      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اُغْتُضِرَ</span></b>  <i>he died being a youth,</i> or <i>young man,
in a sound state:</i> (K, TA:) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اُخْتُضِرَ</span>. (TA.)
